Package: ibus-kesara
Architecture: all
Depends: ibus-m17n, m17n-db, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Kesara Sinhala phonetic input method for IBus
 Kesara converts Singlish-style Latin typing into Sinhala Unicode.
 This package installs the m17n table used by ibus-m17n
 (m17n:si:kesara).

Package: fcitx5-kesara
Architecture: any
Depends: fcitx5, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Kesara Sinhala phonetic input method for Fcitx 5
 Native Fcitx 5 engine for the Kesara Sinhala phonetic keyboard,
 matching the original m17n conversion rules.

Package: fcitx-kesara
Architecture: any
Depends: fcitx, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Kesara Sinhala phonetic input method for Fcitx 4
 Native Fcitx 4 engine for the Kesara Sinhala phonetic keyboard,
 matching the original m17n conversion rules.
